    <!-- v335: a human lawyer's cases. A held Playerz offers the case by text (call the contact to take it) while the
         lawyer is hired, licensed and clocked in; meet the client at Mission Row (the meeting spot, CodeWalker: floor
         29.71, 5.6 m of headroom), then argue at the office computer (Top lawyer's office): one question per charge,
         a right answer beats it. Retainer = RetainerMin-RetainerMax + the per-star cost (F10 lawyerCostPerStar) per
         star, plus FeePerWinPercent per case won (cap FeeCapPercent); BonusPerCharge per charge beaten. Each case won
         also gives OddsPerWin (cap OddsCap) that a wrong answer still beats its charge. OfferSeconds to take it,
         CaseMinutes (real) to finish it; the client stays in holding meanwhile. -->
    <Cases Enabled="true" RetainerMin="5000" RetainerMax="7500" BonusPerCharge="1500" PublicDefenderPay="1000" FeePerWinPercent="5"
           FeeCapPercent="100" OddsPerWin="0.02" OddsCap="0.30" OfferSeconds="60" CaseMinutes="30"
